<title>DUBAI: Britain's Prince Charles in UAE for anniversary.</title>
<headline>Britain's Prince Charles in UAE for anniversary.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prince Charles arrived in Abu Dhabi on Tuesday to attend celebrations marking the United Arab Emirates' 25th anniversary of independence from Britain.</p>
<p>The official news agency WAM said the British heir to the throne would also congratulate UAE President Sheikh Zaid bin Sultan al-Nahayan on his 30 years in power.</p>
<p>The UAE celebrated both occasions amid great fanfare on Monday.</p>
</text>
